{"type":"Film","id":"HU2017_017","slug":"hu2017-017-kojot","title":{"native":"Kojot","english":"Coyote"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2017-02-14","year":2017},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Márk Kostyál","slug":"mark-kostyal","name":"Márk Kostyál","birthYear":1976,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Hungary","awards":[]}],"genre":["Drama","Action","Western"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt5641832/mediaviewer/rm2324119296/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fCmbJbhgBVc"},"synopsis":{"native":"Misi egy kiábrándult fiatalember, aki megörökölte nagyapja házát és birtokát. Elkezdi újjáépíteni a házat, de ezzel a helyi kiskirály érdekeit sérti. Kemény küzdelem kezdődik a vagyonért, a szerelemért és az életért.","english":"Muggy heat, small-town bleakness, unspoken social problems, hierarchy fights. This is Tuzko town, somewhere in Hungary, nowadays. Here comes Misi who inherits his grandfather's house and his property. Misi is a disillusioned, frustrated, constantly refugee young man. He can't find his role in his life, his job and relationship. He starts to build and renovate the house with some men from the town, but it violates the local oligarch's interests. Hard struggle begins for the property, for the love and for the life."},"production":[{"country":"Hungary","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Attila Bocsárszky","slug":"attila-bocsarszky","name":"Attila Bocsárszky","birthYear":1965,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Slovakia","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Frigyes Kovács","slug":"frigyes-kovacs","name":"Frigyes Kovács","birthYear":1955,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Serbia","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Gyula Kovács","slug":"gyula-kovacs","name":"Gyula Kovács","birthYear":1949,"deathYear":2019,"gender":"Male identifying","nationa